  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;本整合包旨在將來自多元宇宙的所有超級英雄，帶入一個除了原世界生物之外，還充滿葛瑞姆（Grimm）致命生物的遊戲世界。此外，本整合包也收錄了豐富多樣的內容，包含可供探索的異次元、等待發現的新戰利品、科技與魔法系統，以及從龐大複雜的模組到簡單有趣的模組，同時在模組選配上力求平衡。最初我設計此整合包純粹為了個人使用，但在實際遊玩數月並反覆調整無數次後，我决定將其公開分享。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Lucraft 附加模組</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/ben-10-addon/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ben 10 附加模組</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/heroesuniverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">英雄宇宙</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/rwby-fusion-breakout\" rel=\"nofollow\">RWBY 融合突圍</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/the-umbrella-academy#c2\" rel=\"nofollow\">陰傘學院</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模組</span></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/angry-pixel-the-betweenlands-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">[ANGRY PIXEL] The Betweenlands (by MrCompost)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/actually-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Actually Additions (by Ellpeck)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/actually-baubles\" rel=\"nofollow\">Actually Baubles (by Jackyy)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-book\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advancement Book (by ParkerMc01)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/akashic-tome\" rel=\"nofollow\">Akashic Tome (by Vazkii)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/anvil-infinity-craft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Anvil Infinity Craft (by AnvilcraftMC)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin (by squeek502)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architecturecraft-tridev\" rel=\"nofollow\">ArchitectureCraft - TridentMC Version (by darkevilmac)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autoreglib\" rel=\"nofollow\">AutoRegLib (by Vazkii)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avatar-armory-addonmod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Avatar Armory AddOnMod (by ezzadawi03s)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avatar-mod-2-out-of-the-iceberg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Avatar Mod 2: Out of the Iceberg (by FavouriteDragon)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avengers-tech\" rel=\"nofollow\">AvengersTech (by LeoPotter)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/baubles\" rel=\"nofollow\">Baubles (by Azanor13)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-advancements\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Advancements (by way2muchnoise)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-builders-wands\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Builder's Wands (by Portablejim)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterfps\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterFps (by Guichaguri)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bibliocraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">BiblioCraft (by Nuchaz)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biome-staff\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Staff (by TheRealp455w0rd)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bookshelf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bookshelf (by DarkhaxDev)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountifulbaubles\" rel=\"nofollow\">BountifulBaubles (by Cursed1nferno)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brandons-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brandon's Core (by brandon3055)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-gadgets\" rel=\"nofollow\">Building Gadgets (by Direwolf20)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caves-and-cliffs\" rel=